{"id":"beats-98801d","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-35fe93b4-ce7d-4889-8068-8b27aa2a017d","text":"Refactored web UI components to align with v2 data model.\n\nKey changes:\n- Replaced `KindBadge` with `LabelBadge` in `Board`, `Backlog`, `Dependencies`, and `IssueDetailModal`.\n- Labels are now styled with specific colors (blue for feature, red for bug, purple for epic).\n- Removed deprecated fields: `checklist`, `logged_effort`, and `kind`-based logic.\n- Updated `Dashboard` to remove deprecated metrics.\n- Fixed runtime error in `App.tsx` and `PendingEventsPanel.tsx` by safeguarding `pending.events` access.\n- User updated `Badge.tsx` styling directly."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T12:41:28.092925Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-98801d","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T12:41:44.222826Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2e80a8","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"The beats config command displays the contents of the .beats/config.yml file, but keys are missing underscores","labels":["bug"]},"created_at":"2026-02-10T12:58:11.993804Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2e80a8","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-ae17d89f-00ff-4074-8f22-73b6c0edf36a","text":"Fix: Config YAML display bug. Added explicit yaml struct tags for all config fields with underscores. Now, beats config displays all keys with underscores as intended. Tested with make build and output verified."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T13:02:31.345664Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-2e80a8","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T13:02:31.373075Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3210ed","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Add a `beats link` command to add a dependency between two issues; support the -t --type options to specify the kind of dependency","labels":["feature"]},"created_at":"2026-02-10T14:18:57.566632Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3210ed","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"PLANNED"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T14:24:21.912872Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3210ed","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-a4b1f100-39db-4a23-8797-b156feb2f956","text":"Walkthrough:\n\n- Added beats link command (cmd/beats/link.go) to enable linking issues with dependency types via CLI.\n- Command syntax: beats link \u003csource-id\u003e \u003ctarget-id\u003e -t \u003ctype\u003e\n- Supported types: blocks, blocked_by, depends_on, dependency_of, duplicates, duplicated_by, relates_to.\n- Issues and types validated. Error output for invalid args.\n- Links are appended as UPDATE events to .beats/issues.db, visible via show.\n- Multiple link types allowed, error handling for invalid types tested.\n- Tested with live issues: confirm dependencies are shown in history and Dependencies block.\n- Edge cases, error scenarios, and reciprocal links are handled cleanly."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T15:12:02.590259Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-3210ed","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T15:12:06.805462Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-dece42","type":"CREATE","payload":{"title":"Standardize status icons and redesign backlog view","description":"Create SVG circle-based StatusIcon component and redesign backlog view with 4 collapsible status-grouped tables inspired by Linear.","labels":["UI"]},"created_at":"2026-02-10T15:33:46.52826Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-dece42","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DOING"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T15:34:05.178737Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-dece42","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-40cf5137-2854-48d3-82ce-37f5106a1e58","text":"Walkthrough: Added shared StatusIcon component with SVG icons for all statuses (BACKLOG=dashed circle, PLANNED=outlined circle, DOING=half-filled, BLOCKED=filled with X, DONE=filled with checkmark). Redesigned Backlog view with collapsible sections, table layout, and refined label badges. Replaced all emoji indicators with StatusIcon in Board and Dashboard views. Verified visually across all views."},"created_at":"2026-02-10T16:42:57.248861Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
{"id":"beats-dece42","type":"UPDATE","payload":{"status":"DONE"},"created_at":"2026-02-10T16:43:02.325069Z","created_by":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@kuy.io\u003e"}
